    "self-hosting.costs.h1": "What to prepare before deploying, and who pays",
    "self-hosting.costs.kicker": "SELF-HOSTING · COSTS &amp; DEPENDENCIES",
    "self-hosting.costs.lede1": "MIAO source is licensed under Apache License 2.0 and the software itself is free; ",
    "self-hosting.costs.lede2": "but in a self-hosted deployment the server, domain, backups, model inference and mail service are prepared and paid for by the operator. ",
    "self-hosting.costs.lede3": "This page lists each dependency's purpose, who configures and pays, and what breaks without it. Every claim traces to the LICENSE, the ",
    "self-hosting.costs.lede4": ", or vendor pages (checked 2026-10-12). ",
    "self-hosting.costs.lede5": "This page offers no MIAO commercial plans and no quotes.",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.lead": "AI that is unconfigured, disabled, or blocked by budget is rejected before a request record is created; failed calls and connection checks also consume budget:",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_jev_body": " candidate selection and decision validation are unavailable; conversational app building, UI edits and publication decisions (the public scope in a publish candidate is decided by Jev) cannot proceed.",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_jev_label": "Without a JEV decision model:",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_llm_body": " assistant proposals and UI drafts for open-ended requests are unavailable.",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_llm_label": "Without an LLM generation model:",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_mail_body": " registration verification and invitation emails are affected, as above.",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_mail_label": "Without a mail service:",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_model_body": " sign-in and permissions, manual data table and record management, status flows, background jobs within existing authorization, published public-page reads.",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.no_model_label": "Works without any model once configured:",
    "self-hosting.costs.limits.title": "What is limited without a model or Jev",
    "self-hosting.costs.meta": "External services, cost ownership and impact of missing configuration before self-hosting MIAO.",
    "self-hosting.costs.ops_link": "operations guide",
    "self-hosting.costs.responsibilities.body1": "Upgrades and rollback, backup and restore verification, HTTPS and availability are the operator's responsibility. ",
    "self-hosting.costs.responsibilities.body2": "The release script switches back to the previous release if startup or health checks fail, but the database is never rolled back automatically; keep a fresh backup and rehearse restores in an isolated environment. ",
    "self-hosting.costs.responsibilities.body3": "A 200 health response does not validate models, mail or the production domain.",
